      "printedParagraph": "After the Revelation, a target opponent can show you their hand. If they do, choose a manifestation inside it, the opponent Chains that manifestation. If the opponent does not show you their hand or if they cannot Chain, put 2 tokens with 2 power {H} in Support.",
